Current main is dca3def (2026-11-04). The physician path is /viewer and
«Анализировать исследование»: local frame preparation, then remote Gemini and
Opus. A detector runs only when its loopback service answers with verified
weights. /technical downloads pinned weights on eligible Linux, installs their
pinned Python programs, and never does either on a Mac. Hemorrhage stays limited
to a pre-approved public study. PE is not deployed.
Do not claim universal pathology detection, a browser one-click clinical worker,
or patient-cloud AI. Inspect live main before changing anything. Existing export
is capped at 8,388,608 voxels; do not raise it to force a run.

Feature work stays on a branch. Do not force-push main. No editing, printing or
committing web/.env.local. No real patient cloud upload; leave the privacy gate
fail-closed. Do not replace a silent specialist model with an LLM guess. Report
what actually ran and what remains untested on the Mac. The 2026-10-11 R1 note
is history, not the next task.
